Q: How to execute a query for each row of results from another query within a CodeIgniter view A: <p>Simply</p>

<pre><code>&lt;?php 
                        $qryd='select * from '.$tbname.'';
                        $queryd = $this-&gt;db-&gt;query($qryd);
                        $resultset = $queryd-&gt;result_array();
                    ?&gt;
</code></pre>
